# COMMIT MESSAGE TEMPLATE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FORMAT:  <BacklogID>: <Short imperative summary> (50 chars max)
#
# BACKLOG ID PREFIXES
#   S1-xx  Sprint 1 tasks
#   S2-xx  Sprint 2 tasks
#   TP-xx  Testing Phase tasks (TP-01 to TP-08)
#   FIX    Bug fixes not tied to a specific backlog item
#   DOC    Documentation-only changes
#   CHORE  Build, CI, dependency, or config changes
#
# EXAMPLES
#   S2-01: Add NVD REST API lookup module
#   TP-03: Validate risk scoring against CVSS baseline
#   FIX: Correct Nmap timeout handling on unreachable hosts
#   DOC: Update README pipeline diagram
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
